    "detail": "27 Form A rows sum to 13,446.74 exactly = the schedule's printed footer total = the cover's This-Report column. The cover's Cumulative cell is 73,827.00 and its Totals-from-Last-Report cell is 60,380.26 (73,827.00 - 60,380.26 = 13,446.74), so this December-5 FINAL report's schedule is PERIOD-scoped behind a cumulative cover: the 60,380.26 raised in earlier 2024 periods is not itemized on this document. No figure was synthesized by differencing covers - the This-Report cell is printed on this filing's own cover. 2024 is the 3-line variant, so there is no separate <=$50 aggregate line. No in-kind rows are labelled on this schedule, so the monetary-only and monetary-plus-in-kind conventions coincide."
   },
